<title>UK: Citibank sets warrants on Schneider.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets warrants on Schneider.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank N.A. in New York, has issued six million American-style call warrants, in two equal tranches, on Schneider SA, lead manager Citibank said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p>TEN WARRANTS CONTROL ONE SHARE.</p>
<p> PAYDATE	   21.APR.97		 LISTING	PARIS</p>
<p> MIN EXER LOT    1000			SPOT REF     330.4 FRF</p>
<p>* * * * * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE	MATURITY   STRIKE    ISSUE	GEARING  PREMIUM</p>
<p> CALL	21.APR.98  340 FRF   5.80 FRF   5.7 X    20.46 PCT</p>
<p> CALL	21.APR.99  380 FRF   5.10 FRF   6.5 X    30.45 PCT</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
